OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic recycling centre
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recycling plant in Nottinghamshire
OL,7,Fhas been recommended for approval
OL,8,Fdespite more than 1,200 residents
OL,9,Fopposing the plans.
OL,11,FEnvale UK has submitted its application
OL,12,Ffor a new plastic chemical recycling
OL,13,Ffacility, with an energy recovery
OL,14,Ffacility, on an old recycling site in
OL,15,FWorksop.
OL,17,FThe operator of the site off Shireoaks
OL,18,FRoad was subject to environmental
OL,19,Fenforcement action in 2013 requiring
OL,20,Fthe removal of waste.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
