OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic recycling centre
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire County Council's
OL,7,Fplanning officers have recommended the
OL,8,Fproposal for approval, with a meeting
OL,9,Fset to take place on 3 November.
